# Netlify _redirects — Padma Shree Travels

# ── Internal CRM — not linked from site, not indexed ─────────────────────────
# /crm/ root returns 404 so guessing the path doesn't reveal anything.
# Staff access via the direct file URL: /crm/pst-crm-simple.html
/crm/          /    404
# Ensures clean URLs work and legacy .html paths redirect properly

# ── Internal archive — superseded/orphaned files, not part of the live site ──
# No staff access needed here (unlike /crm/), so block the whole tree.
/_archive/*    /    404

# ── Internal SEO working files (audits, trackers, review verification) ───────
# Not part of the public site; never indexable.
/_seo/*        /    404

# ── Domain canonicalisation: force all traffic to custom domain ──────────────
# Must be FIRST so Netlify evaluates them before path-based rules.
# The ! suffix forces redirect even when a matching file exists.
https://padmashreetravels.netlify.app/*  https://padmashreetravels.in/:splat  301!
http://padmashreetravels.netlify.app/*   https://padmashreetravels.in/:splat  301!

